[notyet]
It's a miracle!
<p>
As one of {sw_hades} BULFs goes and picks you up to take you to the BOWELS of ~rHELL~.,
 it trips over its feet, and falls over the island's edge to it's doom!
<p>
You escape to your own island, ready to face {sw_hades} again!
$Button=Let's try this again,MissionBegin,sw_m25


[checkwin]
<?{sw_enDead4}><?{sw_enDead5}><?{sw_enDead6}>
<?{sw_enDead7}><?{sw_enDead8}>
                                                     <h2>VICTORY IS YOURS! </h2>
                        
                           ~[Ipriest.89]   ~[IsunFlyerBomb.14]<br>
<p>
As you make the last sacrifice, you hear a loud tearing, as if
the very fabric of space is being shredded!
<p>
You see before you an opening: first small, then growing very quickly!
Its a bright blue white opening that first surrounds {sw_Hades} and his island, then
engulfs it in flames!
<p>
You watch as the once mighty {sw_hades} melts into the ground in front of you!
<p>
                                                     {sw_hades} yells out to you:
<br><i>
        "What have you done? You have trapped me back into the BOWELS of ~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~r~BHELL~.~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]<i>"
<br>
                        <i>"NOOOOO! I must be free to torment other souls at will!"
<$Config,sw_m30=1>
<$Config,sw_m11=0>
$Button=Congrats! ONTO the celebration!,MissionBegin,sw_m30
</?></?></?></?></?>

